ense deactivation error. Please try again later or contact support for help.'=>'Aṣiṣe olupin iwe-aṣẹ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni igba diẹ tabi kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This license is currently disabled. Please contact support for help.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ti wa ni pipade lọwọlọwọ. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This license has expired. Please contact support to renew it.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ti parẹ. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin lati tun un ṣe.','This license key is not authorized for this plugin. Please verify your license key or contact support for help.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ko ṣiṣẹ fun aaye yii. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This license cannot be used for this plugin. Please contact support for help.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ko le ṣee mu ṣiṣẹ. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','This license does not match the plugin you are trying to activate. Please contact support for assistance.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ko ṣiṣẹ fun aaye yii. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','License key does not match our records. Please contact support for assistance.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ti wa ni pipade lọwọlọwọ. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','No license key provided. Please enter a valid license key.'=>'Ko si ikọkọ iwe-aṣẹ ti a pese. Jọwọ tẹ ikọkọ iwe-aṣẹ to wulo.','Your site URL is required to activate the license. Please enter a valid site URL to continue.'=>'URL aaye rẹ nilo lati mu iwe-aṣẹ ṣiṣẹ. Jọwọ tẹ URL aaye ti o wulo lati tẹsiwaju.','License activation limit reached. Please contact support to upgrade or deactivate on another site.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ti parẹ. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin lati tun un ṣe.','This license cannot be activated. Please contact support for help.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ yii ko le ṣee mu ṣiṣẹ. Jọwọ kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','License server error. Please try again later or contact support for help.'=>'Aṣiṣe olupin iwe-aṣẹ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni igba diẹ tabi kan si atilẹyin fun iranlọwọ.','The license server returned an invalid response. Please try again later or contact support for help.'=>'A